    The content of this website is provided for general information about the Company and
    its regulatory status. It does not constitute investment advice, a personal
    recommendation, or an offer or solicitation to buy or sell any financial instrument.
  </p>

  <h2>2. No offer where unauthorised</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website should be read as an offer or invitation to residents of a
    jurisdiction where such an offer would be unauthorised.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Risk warning</h2>
