    While the Company takes care to keep the information on this website accurate and
    current, it is provided “as is”, without warranty of any kind. To the extent permitted
    by law, the Company accepts no liability for loss arising from reliance on this
    website’s content or from interruptions to its availability.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Governing law</h2>
  <p set:html={tok(
    'These terms are governed by the laws of [JURISDICTION], and the courts of [JURISDICTION] have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute arising from them.'
  )} />

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p set:html={tok(
    'Questions regarding these terms can be addressed to compliance@[DOMAIN] or in writing to [FULL REGISTERED ADDRESS].'
  )} />

  <p class="note" set:html={tok('Last updated: [DATE].')} />
